      {
        "id": 105367,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-30T16:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It is because you can play Boosts after each event. So it looks like this:</p><p>-Activate R icons</p><p>-Play Boosts (optional)</p><p>-Gain credits</p><p><span>It doesn't matter what cards you have at the beginning of the phase, all that matters is the cards at the beginning of the Gain Credits event. I think the example is right, and the rule book should have said \"at the beginning of the Gain Credits Event\" and not \"the beginning of the Requisition phase.\"</span></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:34:57.102Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
