        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It is because you can play Boosts after each event. So it looks like this:</p><p>-Activate R icons</p><p>-Play Boosts (optional)</p><p>-Gain credits</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">It doesn&#39;t matter what cards you have at the beginning of the phase, all that matters is the cards at the beginning of the Gain Credits event. I think the example is right, and the rule book should have said &quot;at the beginning of the Gain Credits Event&quot; and not &quot;the beginning of the Requisition phase.&quot;</span></p>",
